        "edit": "Changed the least-significant BCD digit rollover threshold from 10 to 9 (Q[3:0] != 9) so the digit counts 0-9 and carries at 9, matching the oracle behavior observed at cycle 27.",
        "lens_id": "dataflow_v1",
